{"3485580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bodybuilder Simulator CO-OP", "steam_appid": 3485580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bodybuilder Simulator CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodybuilder Simulator</strong> is a third-person open-world game set on a forgotten Italian island, where sport is not a choice — it’s a necessity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏝️ A Living Open World of Training and Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on an isolated island where every inhabitant lives by a rhythm of training, work, and competition. This is a world where physical condition defines your opportunities, status, and the respect you earn from others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building can be explored, and the island is full of life — from gyms and homes to competitive bodybuilding venues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/ccbbff534757d684abe5a005181ffbf7.poster.avif?t=1786620313\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/ccbbff534757d684abe5a005181ffbf7.webm?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/ccbbff534757d684abe5a005181ffbf7.mp4?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧬 Create Your Own Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with an advanced character creator that allows deep customization:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >body fat percentage and muscle mass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >genetic traits and physical predispositions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >detailed face and body customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >skin tone and many other parameters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make affects your character’s development and potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/14fd8b87cd02f4885e0a4e592c25ed96.poster.avif?t=1786620313\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/14fd8b87cd02f4885e0a4e592c25ed96.webm?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/14fd8b87cd02f4885e0a4e592c25ed96.mp4?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💪 Realistic Training and Body Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 100 exercises recreated from real-world movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every workout visibly and physically transforms your body:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >muscles tighten and change shape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >veins become more visible under strain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >skin reacts to body fat levels and training intensity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fatigue affects exercise execution and technique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >facial expressions reflect real effort and exhaustion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nutrition, supplementation, and recovery (sleep) are essential — neglecting any of them will impact your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍕 Lifestyle Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eat junk food and live a passive lifestyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or train consistently, follow a strict diet, and push your body to its peak</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision has consequences — from appearance to performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/b195a0f581a7d34052e6d8143cde95b2.poster.avif?t=1786620313\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/b195a0f581a7d34052e6d8143cde95b2.webm?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/b195a0f581a7d34052e6d8143cde95b2.mp4?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Career and Competitions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in bodybuilding competitions across multiple categories and build your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also take photos of your character to track progress and compare your physical transformation over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Living NPC System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is inhabited by NPCs who:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >follow their own daily routines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >train in gyms and develop their bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >react to your physique and behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change their bodies over time (muscle gain / fat gain)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can train with them, help them improve, or compete against them. They also react emotionally — they may support you or criticize you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏋️ Gym and Home Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gym and house are fully customizable:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy and upgrade equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change colors, textures, and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >add decorations, posters, and electronics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >expand and evolve your training space</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both locations are highly interactive and grow with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/9b5ede924a0a207d15695b0814d11253.poster.avif?t=1786620313\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/9b5ede924a0a207d15695b0814d11253.webm?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/9b5ede924a0a207d15695b0814d11253.mp4?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💼 Work and Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress, you must earn money — balancing work with your bodybuilding career and investing in your development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥊 More Than Bodybuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to bodybuilding, the game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >martial arts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >swimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >calisthenics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strongman training</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deep story-driven career mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full open-world sandbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >planned: co-op mode for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is not just a simulator. It’s a life where strength defines everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your wishlist and follow the development.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bodybuilder Simulator CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodybuilder Simulator</strong> is a third-person open-world game set on a forgotten Italian island, where sport is not a choice — it’s a necessity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏝️ A Living Open World of Training and Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on an isolated island where every inhabitant lives by a rhythm of training, work, and competition. This is a world where physical condition defines your opportunities, status, and the respect you earn from others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building can be explored, and the island is full of life — from gyms and homes to competitive bodybuilding venues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/ccbbff534757d684abe5a005181ffbf7.poster.avif?t=1786620313\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/ccbbff534757d684abe5a005181ffbf7.webm?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/ccbbff534757d684abe5a005181ffbf7.mp4?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧬 Create Your Own Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with an advanced character creator that allows deep customization:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >body fat percentage and muscle mass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >genetic traits and physical predispositions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >detailed face and body customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >skin tone and many other parameters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice