ry decision has consequences — from appearance to performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/b195a0f581a7d34052e6d8143cde95b2.poster.avif?t=1786620313\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/b195a0f581a7d34052e6d8143cde95b2.webm?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/b195a0f581a7d34052e6d8143cde95b2.mp4?t=1786620313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Career and Competitions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in bodybuilding competitions across multiple categories and build your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also take photos of your character to track progress and compare your physical transformation over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Living NPC System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is inhabited by NPCs who:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >follow their own daily routines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >train in gyms and develop their bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >react to your physique and behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change their bodies over time (muscle gain / fat gain)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can train with them, help them improve, or compete against them. They also react emotionally — they may support you or criticize you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏋️ Gym and Home Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gym and house are fully customizable:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy and upgrade equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change colors, textures, and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >add decorations, posters,